.TH FATHOM_NOTE_LIST 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-note\-list \- List what is recorded, oldest first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom note list\fR [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fITARGET\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List what is recorded, oldest first
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
Only this kind: `decision`, `question`, `follow\-up`, `annotation`
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<STATUS>\fR
Only notes in this status: `open`, `answered`, `withdrawn`
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 0]
How many to print, oldest first; `0` is every note
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fITARGET\fR]
Only notes attached to this episode or touching this path
